WEBVTT

00:04:28.973 --> 00:04:33.185
OK, the actual good news
is that our lives are full of humor,

00:04:33.185 --> 00:04:34.812
if we know how to look for it.

00:04:34.854 --> 00:04:36.147
JA: Here's the secret.

00:04:36.188 --> 00:04:39.650
Don't look for what's funny,
just notice what's true.

00:04:40.192 --> 00:04:42.611
We asked some of you
what's true in your own lives,

00:04:42.611 --> 00:04:44.905
and here's a few things we heard.

00:04:44.947 --> 00:04:48.242
NB: "Since working from home, I only comb
the front part of my hair."

00:04:48.284 --> 00:04:50.494
(Laughter)

00:04:50.536 --> 00:04:52.455
JA: "I only like my own kids ..."

00:04:52.496 --> 00:04:53.497
(Laughter)

00:04:53.539 --> 00:04:54.915
“There, I said it.”

00:04:55.041 --> 00:04:57.501
NB: So this is not
about becoming a comedian.

00:04:57.543 --> 00:05:00.296
This is about looking at the world
in a different way.